{"1754250": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "We Took That Trip", "steam_appid": 1754250, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>PLAY THE DEMO</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754250/extras/34bc9c94a9f48842796cc89810805248.poster.avif?t=1780623025\" width=780 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754250/extras/34bc9c94a9f48842796cc89810805248.webm?t=1780623025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754250/extras/34bc9c94a9f48842796cc89810805248.mp4?t=1780623025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754250/extras/4a8c6700e5be29da9ccba927073fc3ec.avif?t=1780623025\" width=780 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready for the most relaxing road trip of your life? Waking up on a beach far away, set off across an endless procedurally generated landscape, driving the iconic Microbus and enjoying the ride. There are no deadlines, no pressing objectives, no world to save: Just you, a van, your cat, and an endless road filled with beautiful sights to see, interesting people to meet, and peace to be found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754250/extras/dea421fd1342c930dc14e60ea6873c48.poster.avif?t=1780623025\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754250/extras/dea421fd1342c930dc14e60ea6873c48.webm?t=1780623025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754250/extras/dea421fd1342c930dc14e60ea6873c48.mp4?t=1780623025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754250/extras/480c434931cfbfe58da54f3d469240ca.avif?t=1780623025\" width=780 height=90 /></span><strong>What awaits you on the road?</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754250/extras/d4ee92700ea118a10f115d3f1f21498f.poster.avif?t=1780623025\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754250/extras/d4ee92700ea118a10f115d3f1f21498f.webm?t=1780623025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754250/extras/d4ee92700ea118a10f115d3f1f21498f.mp4?t=1780623025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Rides: </strong>Every trip lasts as long as you want, thanks to an endless, procedurally generated map with points of interest sprinkled along the way: Gas stations, stores, lookout towers, and new friends to make.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three Distinct Modes:</strong> Hit the road in Story Mode, with a heartwarming tale about friendship and loss. Switch to Zen Mode and go on a ride that's unique each time you drive. Or use Background Mode and let the ride unfold in the background as you tuck in and chill.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754250/extras/4964fdd629cc487366119ce07d7a94f5.poster.avif?t=1780623025\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754250/extras/4964fdd629cc487366119ce07d7a94f5.webm?t=1780623025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754250/extras/4964fdd629cc487366119ce07d7a94f5.mp4?t=1780623025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Driving: </strong>Jump in the driver's seat, turn the key, release the parking brake, and head out. Turn on the wipers when it's raining, fiddle with the radio, and if the battery ever dies, push start the van back on the road. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Home: </strong>Make your home away from home look the way you want it inside and outside with paints, stickers, decorations. Live on the road in your personalized van together with your feline friend. Yes, you can pet the cat - and every other animal you meet!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754250/extras/2da0e66c05ae91b8286589217910d191.poster.avif?t=1780623025\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754250/extras/2da0e66c05ae91b8286589217910d191.webm?t=1780623025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754250/extras/2da0e66c05ae91b8286589217910d191.mp4?t=1780623025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lo-Fi Beats: </strong>Chill out to the tun